THIRD-PARTY COMPONENTS / 第三方组件声明

1. PyQt6 (Riverbank Computing) — licensed under the GNU LGPL v3.
   This project uses PyQt6 unmodified via its published Python bindings.
   The MIT license above applies to THIS PROJECT'S CODE ONLY, not to PyQt6.

   The distributed single-file executable is provided for convenience. To
   comply with the LGPL "user-replaceable library" requirement, the complete
   source tree is included so that the application can be rebuilt against a
   system-installed PyQt6 (e.g. `pip install PyQt6` + `python main.py`, or a
   PyInstaller build without bundled PyQt6 binaries). If you redistribute
   binaries of this application, you must do the same and honor the LGPL v3
   terms for PyQt6 itself (see https://www.riverbankcomputing.com/software/pyqt/intro
   and https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html).

2. pynput — licensed under the GNU LGPL v3. Same terms as above apply.

3. PyInstaller — licensed under the GPL with a special exception that allows
   its output (the bootloader) to be used in projects of any license.
   See https://pyinstaller.org/en/stable/license.html

